AWS thread - the AWS support-case email naming the public GitHub file that held the key,
and the moment the key was disabled.
```
index=botsv3 (sourcetype=stream:smtp "AKIAJOGCDXJ5NW5PXUPA") OR (sourcetype=aws:cloudtrail eventName=UpdateAccessKey)
| spath subject
| spath sender
| eval event=coalesce(eventName, subject)
| eval detail=coalesce('requestParameters.status'." key ".'requestParameters.accessKeyId'." for ".'requestParameters.userName', "from ".sender)
| table _time sourcetype event detail
| sort _time
